  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-08-01T23:20:51-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, August 1, 2017, 11:20 pm\">August 1, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<h3>Meet The Artists <a title=\"Original source page returned 404\" href>Weedie Tyldesley</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (source page unavailable)</span> and <a href=\"http://www.felosartcapecod.com/\">Elaine Felos Ostrander</a> at a free demonstration on Saturday, August 12 from 2 to 4 pm at The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3257\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-3257\" src=\"/media/archive/28dc75250e746cb8bf642e817957fb311ecb568c5d912fd19800d8503c2d43c7.jpg\" alt=\"©Weedie Tyldesley, Summer Flowers\" width=\"477\" height=\"636\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3257\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">©Weedie Tyldesley, Summer Flowers</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Weedie will be painting an arrangement of summer flowers in acrylic on canvas.</p>\n<p>Known for her complicated sports montages, Elaine will demonstrate her process of transferring an idea from a sketch to the desired painting surface, then using watercolor paints and Caran Dache crayons, turn the sketch into a completed painting.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3258\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-3258\" src=\"/media/archive/36c89ff5a447f270a9107c03925d843c5b9c623a7cc06cbab4261f7cda84a262.jpg\" alt=\"©Elaine Felos Ostrander, Sports Montage\" width=\"614\" height=\"616\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3258\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">©Elaine Felos Ostrander, Sports Montage</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists, 551 Main Street (Route 28), Harwich Port, is open 7-days a week, including extended hours for <a href=\"http://harwichcc.com/cape-cod-vacation/port-summer-nights/\">Summer Port Nights</a>. The Art Gallery exhibits original artwork by 24 local artists. Free public parking located across the street at the Tourist Information Center of the Harwich Chamber of Commerce. Refreshments will be served.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-74004cd9be5de0d40a61/\" rel=\"tag\">EVENTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a2dd2a8b0cc8efdccc38/\" rel=\"tag\">MEET THE ARTIST</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-3b7a7197884c65093e45/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-b96a9f5cca619188590c/\" rel=\"tag\">Elaine Felos Ostrander</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-f18b6b2015591a4dcc51/\" rel=\"tag\">Meet The Artist</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-b9ab081a4bc798f19819/\" rel=\"tag\">The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-4eb958c8ea474845bb0f/\" rel=\"tag\">The Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-1904651b7a8d00a44290/\" rel=\"tag\">Weedie Tyldesley</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
